# Single source of truth for cargo-llvm-cov --ignore-filename-regex.
# Keep in sync with codecov.yml `ignore:` (paths only; this file is the regex form).
#
# src/main.rs              — binary entry, eframe::run_native / process::exit
# src/gui/mod.rs           — eframe App shell (native window lifecycle)
# src/gui/views/           — egui rendering only; logic lives in ops/workers
# src/drive.rs             — OS-specific enumerate/find_backend paths
# src/gui/file_dialog.rs   — rfd native dialog adapter (one impl, mocked in tests)
# src/process_runner.rs    — NativeRunner thin OS process adapter (trait mocked)
#
# Do not ignore domain modules (command, flash, orchestration, process, sdf, …).
src/main\.rs|src/gui/mod\.rs|src/gui/views/|src/drive\.rs|src/gui/file_dialog\.rs|src/process_runner\.rs
